-- EPE Sample Oral Exam (Sept 2024) — official VWU sample: choose one of
-- two topics (each a pair of contrasting photos + 3 guiding questions
-- split Part A/Part B), ~20 min prep, ~7 min discussion with the
-- examiner. Both provided samples are under the same topic pool entry
-- ("Hobbies and free-time activities and celebrating special events"),
